    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "ms::p16::esc915",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "0004bbeef01d362d262dfe76f4bd5edd938077e64c790398e87c781ecb930ca6",
      "resource_identity": "5f144168d70bd3d1a0fd6976552c29402b691ad7a386cb5ef372ad9ba2b59732",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I feel sad, and feel like need help",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Can you identify why you feel sad?",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "yes, my aunt pass away a couple weeks ago",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "and since then im feeling really sad",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It is natural to feel sad when someone you care about dies.",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "IS there something I can do to feel better?",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Are you with family?   Sometimes it helps to be with others who are grieving?",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "No, I live alone, my family lives in another state",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Being by yourself is rough after a death.    Can you talk with your family by phone?   Do you have a friend who has gone through a similar loss?",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I feel like everybody is in their own bussines and have no time to hear my complains",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I talk to my family, but the whole family is not doing really fine",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It sounds like you feel people think you are complaining when you talk about your Aunt's death making you sad.    Is that correct?",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "yes",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Do you feel you are complaining?",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "yes, I feel like noone wants to listen",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I need to do something by mnyself",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Can you recommend someting for me to do to feel better?",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "My own experiences with family deaths is they are sad.    I just wanted to \"feel better\".    My experience was it did not help to complain about \"being sad\" but it did help to talk about why I missed my family member.     If no one was available,   sometimes I would journal.   Do you think that might help you?",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Well maybe it could works, to mantain distracted",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "thank you",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "You are welcome.    I am sorry about your Aunt.",
          "turn_index": 20
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thnak you, I think it helps to have someone to chat",
          "turn_index": 21
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Makes me feel better to chat a bit with you, helped me to relax",
          "turn_index": 22
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That is why I am here.     Is there anything else you would like to chat about?",
          "turn_index": 23
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I hink, Im fine for now. I will try to keep myself focus on different things",
          "turn_index": 24
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "and try to chat a bit more at leaat with my family",
          "turn_index": 25
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Good bye?",
          "turn_index": 26
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-20",
          "session_id": "esc915",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Good bye!",
          "turn_index": 27
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "ms::p16::esc371",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "38be8150b4b22908d99a8a7e89b4ca733b3cce3046159bbe804a06a0ad5635c1",
      "resource_identity": "30c552079743d40a7fa24b5dd11dbe25e4aa09dbdfed13445b6fbbf0ff7a6b07",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "hi there",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Hello! How are you doing? ",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I'm not doing so good at the moment. I'm feeling very stressed and burned out from work",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That sounds very frustrating. Is this a recent development at your job? ",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "It's been building up for a while now, but it's really starting to get a but overwhelming",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I can understand how that can have an effect on your mental well-being. Have you spoken to your supervisor about your frustrations at work? ",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I have, but sometimes I feel like she doesn't really listen and she sort of talks over me a lot",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It sounds like you don't feel listened to. ",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "That's right... I guess that is quite a lot of the problem. ",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I don't mind so much the work, I know it is busy for everyone right now, it's a combination of the workload plus not being listened to",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I had a similar issue at my last job. My supervisor constantly spoke over me in meetings, and it would drive me crazy. I never could get a word in edge-wise. ",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yeah, that sounds a lot like what I am experiencing",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Are you considering switching jobs? ",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "It's been in the back of my mind, but it's a hard time just now with everything else going on",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Absolutely. It's a rough time job searching under the best of circumstances. ",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "It is. ",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Have you tried reaching out to anyone in your network to look for a new position? It helped me when I was previously job searching. ",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I haven't, but it might be worth getting in touch with some people",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Absolutely. I also spoke with a therapist before and it helped me a lot. ",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Have you considered reaching out to a professional to talk to? ",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I did consider that, but aren't they expensive?",
          "turn_index": 20
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "They can be, but many local governments and municipalities have therapists that work on a sliding scale if the financial aspect of therapy is a concern. ",
          "turn_index": 21
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Therapy can definitely be a large expense though. ",
          "turn_index": 22
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "It might be worth it in the long run though I guess, if it helps how I am feeling",
          "turn_index": 23
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "If it helps to reframe the expense, you can try to think of it as an investment in your mental health. ",
          "turn_index": 24
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yes, that sounds like a more positive way of thinking of it",
          "turn_index": 25
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "The therapist could likely give you some tools to help manage the frustrations at your workplace more constructively. ",
          "turn_index": 26
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p16",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc371",
